id: usagi-majin
name: Usagi Majin
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Neko Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Greedy and jealous, you seek to steal the Majin-Dama of the powerful Neko-Majins to become the strongest around... And you'll resort to any petty tactic, even threatening their action figures, to accomplish that goal.
